{{!-- components/tag-pills.hbs — a post's tags.

     The design system's `.ns-tag--pill` in a `.ns-strip`. The theme drew its
     own pill out of six utilities; the system's is the same shape with the
     hover, the dark-mode ink and the focus ring already decided.

     Ghost's {{tags}} skips internal (#) tags unless asked, so the art-direction
     and metadata tags never leak onto the page. --}}
{{#if tags}}
  <div class="ns-strip">
    {{#foreach tags}}
      <a href="{{url}}" class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{name}}</a>
    {{/foreach}}
  </div>
{{/if}}
